WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
Start the design: In Fusion 360, open the Design workspace and select the Solid tab.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:08.400
Create a sketch: Choose Create Sketch and select an origin plane such as XY.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.600
Sketch geometry: Use rectangle and circle tools; apply dimensions and constraints.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:16.800
Make solids: Finish Sketch, then Solid > Create > Extrude selected profiles.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:21.000
Assemble components: Create separate components. Use Assemble > Joint for revolute and slider joints.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.200
Check the movement: Drive a joint and compare extreme slider positions; inspect interferences.

